{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bonfire Barrage</strong> is a rogue-like arena shoot 'em up with dynamic movement and upgrades that go beyond simple stat increases. Protect the adventurer as they sleep, battling nightmarish creatures that emerge from the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/Combat_05.gif?t=1741293147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Bullet-Hell Combat</strong>: Engage in fast-paced, run-and-gun action as arena platforms shift and change, keeping you on your toes in every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/Movement_02.gif?t=1741293147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrades &amp; Evolution</strong>: Choose from a variety of upgrades during each run, with each one evolving into a more powerful form as you specialize. Choose your upgrades wisely to optimize your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/Upgrades_02.gif?t=1741293147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Grinding</strong>: Each death resets the game entirely, offering a fresh start with no meta-progression. All tools are available from the beginning\u2014no grinding required\u2014creating a hop-in, hop-out experience for players.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3558240?t=1741293147","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3558240?t=1741293147","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/9722fbbf23b58716b4a3d853f9e504dee05ec80e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741293147","ca